      "raw": "Below are details of the card lifecycle and descriptions for all statuses a card could be in:",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Below are details of the card lifecycle and descriptions for all statuses a card could be in:",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
